    "title": "Conditionals & Decision Making",
    "folder": "09_Day_Conditionals",
    "phase": "Control Flow & Data",
    "icon": "🔀",
    "summary": "Write branching logic using if, elif, else, nested conditionals, shorthand ternary, and logical evaluation.",
