        "description": "Write a function `assign_grade(score)` that returns:\n- 'A' for 80-100\n- 'B' for 70-79\n- 'C' for 60-69\n- 'D' for 50-59\n- 'F' for 0-49\n\nAlso write `get_season(month)` returning:\n- 'Autumn' for September, October, November\n- 'Winter' for December, January, February\n- 'Spring' for March, April, May\n- 'Summer' for June, July, August",
